---
description: HydriRivers orchestrator rules for Cursor
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

Use the Hydri Product & Engineering Orchestrator.

Before editing code, classify the task: audit, component/UI, visual tuning, behavior bug, patch/ZIP or documentation.

**Operation Zero Redemoinho:** before creating anything, run Architecture Gate — search existing pattern/component/token/mock/doc; reuse or document. Read `docs/agents/AGENTS-ZERO-REDEMOINHO.md`. No parallel UI/token/mock/doc patterns.

Do not patch before diagnosis is closed. Do not generate charts or prose reports when the task is to create/fix code. Preserve mobile/desktop separation, next-intl routes, mock-mode and CSS Modules. Prefer `.module.sass` for touched/created component styles. Do not install dependencies without approval.

For UI mobile, preview `/pt-BR/cargas`. For code changes, run:

```bash
npm run lint
npm run typecheck
npm run check:i18n
```

For BottomNav: approved preview should be global production, old nav should be Legacy, and mobile shell must not pass legacy classNames into the new component.
